{
    "title": "Sonic Forces: PvP Battle Race",
    "description": "Sonic the Hedgehog is back and running fast in this cool take on casual multiplayer battle & racing games from SEGA! \r\n\r\nSonic Forces stands out among running games, offering the perfect fusion of endless runner and multiplayer fun race action. Select your iconic racer from the Sonic universe to run, race, and compete in multiplayer running games with real players from around the world for lightning fast competitive race games! Sonic Forces is the ultimate PvP multiplayer racer for fans of running games.\r\n\r\nRace and battle with your favorite characters in Sonic Forces, the ultimate multiplayer running game. Take control of Sonic the Hedgehog, Knuckles, Shadow, and other iconic characters as you compete in fast-paced race games and epic battles through exciting Sonic worlds.\r\n\r\nPlay multiplayer running games to take on other players from around the world in 4 player racing games, dodging obstacles, using power-ups, and become the first racer to cross the finish line! Run and race up classic loop de loops in Green Hill Zone or subway tunnels and streets in Golden Bay Zone. This fun race game is all about speed and strategy, so be sure to bring your A-game!\r\n\r\nThis dynamic run PvP game lets you become the ultimate speed racer, running and racing through stunning landscapes and engaging in epic battles. This isn't just a run-of-the-mill running game; every match is a fun race with an immersive PvP multiplayer experience that seamlessly blends the elements of racing games and battle games. \r\n\r\nSONIC FORCES\r\n\r\nRUN, RACE, AND WIN MULTIPLAYER GAMES!\r\n- Race past the competition in fun run games\r\n- Run fast to win in epic casual multiplayer adventure battles and races!\r\n- Spin, jump and slide your way to multiplayer racing victory with Sonic!\r\n- Complete PvP multiplayer race games to win trophies to unlock more content \r\n- A fun race to the top of the PvP multiplayer racing leaderboards\r\n\r\nPLAY RACING & RUNNING GAMES WITH SONIC & FRIENDS\r\n- Race as Sonic, Amy, Tails, Knuckles, Shadow, and more awesome Sonic heroes\r\n- Use powerful racer specific power ups to finish first\r\n- Battle for rings in every fun race to earn rewards \r\n- Level up and improve your favorite runner\u2019s racing skills\r\n- Join epic running and racing games with Sonic and his friends, dash to victory!\r\n\r\n\r\nCHALLENGING MULTIPLAYER FUN RACE TRACKS\r\n-Are you the fastest racer? Race against 4 players within the iconic Sonic Universe\r\n- Run, battle, jump, and race through Green Hill, Golden Bay, and more unique zones\r\n- Enjoy a fun run upside down on loop de loops, through subway tunnels, or metal pipes\r\n- Experience racing games the Sonic racer way in this spectacular 3D runner game\r\n\r\nDive into the world of endless runner games with Sonic Forces' cooperative multiplayer, creating a unique and thrilling experience that combines strategy and speed. Immerse yourself in the world of endless runner race games, where each race is a new adventure and a chance to become the ultimate endless runner champion.\r\n\r\nIf you're a fan of classic SEGA games, then you won't want to miss Sonic Forces. With fast-paced gameplay, stunning graphics, and tons of content to explore, this runner game is the ultimate Sonic experience. Download Sonic Forces and hit the ground running and jumping into fun race games today!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://privacy.sega.com/en/soa-pp\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.sega.com/EULA\r\n\r\nSEGA games apps are ad-supported and no in-app purchases are required to progress; ad-free play option available with in-app purchase.\r\n\r\nOther than for users known to be under 13, this game may include \"\"Interest Based Ads\"\" and may collect \"\"Precise Location Data\"\". Please see our privacy policy for more information.\r\n\r\nThe following permissions are required for downloading additional game files: READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE & WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE\r\n\r\n\u00a9 SEGA All rights reserved. SEGA, the SEGA logo, SONIC THE HEDGEHOG and SONIC FORCES: SPEED BATTLE are registered trademarks or trademarks of SEGA CORPORATION or its affiliates.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Sonic the Hedgehog is back and running fast in this cool take on casual multiplayer battle &amp; racing games from SEGA! <br><br>Sonic Forces stands out among running games, offering the perfect fusion of endless runner and multiplayer fun race action. Select your iconic racer from the Sonic universe to run, race, and compete in multiplayer running games with real players from around the world for lightning fast competitive race games! Sonic Forces is the ultimate PvP multiplayer racer for fans of running games.<br><br>Race and battle with your favorite characters in Sonic Forces, the ultimate multiplayer running game. Take control of Sonic the Hedgehog, Knuckles, Shadow, and other iconic characters as you compete in fast-paced race games and epic battles through exciting Sonic worlds.<br><br>Play multiplayer running games to take on other players from around the world in 4 player racing games, dodging obstacles, using power-ups, and become the first racer to cross the finish line! Run and race up classic loop de loops in Green Hill Zone or subway tunnels and streets in Golden Bay Zone. This fun race game is all about speed and strategy, so be sure to bring your A-game!<br><br>This dynamic run PvP game lets you become the ultimate speed racer, running and racing through stunning landscapes and engaging in epic battles. This isn&#39;t just a run-of-the-mill running game; every match is a fun race with an immersive PvP multiplayer experience that seamlessly blends the elements of racing games and battle games. <br><br>SONIC FORCES<br><br>RUN, RACE, AND WIN MULTIPLAYER GAMES!<br>- Race past the competition in fun run games<br>- Run fast to win in epic casual multiplayer adventure battles and races!<br>- Spin, jump and slide your way to multiplayer racing victory with Sonic!<br>- Complete PvP multiplayer race games to win trophies to unlock more content <br>- A fun race to the top of the PvP multiplayer racing leaderboards<br><br>PLAY RACING &amp; RUNNING GAMES WITH SONIC &amp; FRIENDS<br>- Race as Sonic, Amy, Tails, Knuckles, Shadow, and more awesome Sonic heroes<br>- Use powerful racer specific power ups to finish first<br>- Battle for rings in every fun race to earn rewards <br>- Level up and improve your favorite runner\u2019s racing skills<br>- Join epic running and racing games with Sonic and his friends, dash to victory!<br><br><br>CHALLENGING MULTIPLAYER FUN RACE TRACKS<br>-Are you the fastest racer? Race against 4 players within the iconic Sonic Universe<br>- Run, battle, jump, and race through Green Hill, Golden Bay, and more unique zones<br>- Enjoy a fun run upside down on loop de loops, through subway tunnels, or metal pipes<br>- Experience racing games the Sonic racer way in this spectacular 3D runner game<br><br>Dive into the world of endless runner games with Sonic Forces&#39; cooperative multiplayer, creating a unique and thrilling experience that combines strategy and speed. Immerse yourself in the world of endless runner race games, where each race is a new adventure and a chance to become the ultimate endless runner champion.<br><br>If you&#39;re a fan of classic SEGA games, then you won&#39;t want to miss Sonic Forces. With fast-paced gameplay, stunning graphics, and tons of content to explore, this runner game is the ultimate Sonic experience. Download Sonic Forces and hit the ground running and jumping into fun race games today!<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://privacy.sega.com/en/soa-pp<br>Terms of Use: https://www.sega.com/EULA<br><br>SEGA games apps are ad-supported and no in-app purchases are required to progress; ad-free play option available with in-app purchase.<br><br>Other than for users known to be under 13, this game may include &quot;&quot;Interest Based Ads&quot;&quot; and may collect &quot;&quot;Precise Location Data&quot;&quot;. Please see our privacy policy for more information.<br><br>The following permissions are required for downloading additional game files: READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE &amp; WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE<br><br>\u00a9 SEGA All rights reserved. SEGA, the SEGA logo, SONIC THE HEDGEHOG and SONIC FORCES: SPEED BATTLE are registered trademarks or trademarks of SEGA CORPORATION or its affiliates.",
